+---
+name: "cross-squad"
+description: "Coordinating work across multiple Squad instances — discovery, delegation, and disambiguation when the user says 'squad' (the product) vs casual English 'group of agents'."
+domain: "orchestration"
+confidence: "medium"
+source: "manual"
+triggers:
+  - "spawn N squads"
